                            ""
                        ],
                        [
                            "Great House",
                            "Yes, No, Mine, Any",
                            "Dynasty holds or held at least a count-level title (?)"
                        ]
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Searching from another character's perspective",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "It is possible to search from another character's perspective:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Right-click on the portrait of the character",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Left-click on the \"Explore Character Opinions\" button",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "This makes it possible to filter for their culture, religion, dynasty, or vassals."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Quirks",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Sorting by \"dynasty\" only sorts by dynasty name .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Sorting by \"age\" only sorts by integer floor of age .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "It is often necessary to refresh the list by clicking the left-hand buttons, or the sort order by switching to another sort and back.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "If you filter after scrolling down, you may see no matches at all until you scroll up.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "To search for lowborn characters, type \"no_dynasty\".",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "To clear the text field, use ^Ctrl + ←Backspace (even on Mac)",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Tips",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "This tool has some intelligent sorting features that are not readily apparent. For instance, if you want to find the Bolghar character with the highest Learning, first click on the book to sort by Learning then click on Culture and scroll. You will now see all the characters sorted by Learning within their Culture."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Mods",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Mods can add traits in order to improve the character finder. The following mods add purely informational traits:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Pact Traits - characters with whom you could negotiate NAPs and alliances",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Heir Traits - title heirs by rank",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The mods below are Ironman-compatible, and available via Steam workshop:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Character Finder Addon - adds color indicators to the Character Portraits, showing different statistics at a glance, such as claims, bloodlines, wealth, artifacts in posession",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "All Artifacts At Once - allows to search for all characters with any artifacts, without specifying each artifact name separately",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}